<title>UK: GMAC unit sets 150 million stg Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GMAC unit sets 150 million stg Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GMAC INTERNATIONAL FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    10.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.996   PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.846    SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
